-## Ollama Provider
-
-**IMPORTANT**: When using Ollama as a provider, you **must** disable streaming to avoid JSON parsing errors.
-
-### Required Configuration
-
-```json
-{
-  "agents": {
-    "explore": {
-      "model": "ollama/qwen3-coder",
-      "stream": false
-    }
-  }
